  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "在岛屿上建设并升级防御塔，持续击退入侵怪潮",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "An exciting tower defense game where you have to defend your island from the invasion of enemy forces. Your task is to build and upgrade towers to repel waves of attacking enemies.",
