      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "五种防御塔各有独立特性，需要按敌情选择配置",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Five types of towers: You have access to five different types of towers for defense. Each tower has its own unique characteristics. Choose wisely to effectively deal with enemies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3027170/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "资源必须集中投入岛屿薄弱点，让塔位覆盖最容易被突破的区域",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Your strategic thinking and ability to effectively use resources will be key in this struggle for survival. Features: - 3D Graphics - Five types of towers: You have access to five different types of towers for defense. Each tower has its own unique characteristics. Choose wisely to effectively deal with enemies. - Variety of enemies: A variety of enemies await you in the game. - Strategic thinking: Place towers so that they cover the most vulnerable points of the island and effectively restrain enemies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/3027170/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
